flowchart TD
 R[Requirement submitted] --> N[Normalize and classify]
 N --> Q{Ambiguous?}
 Q -->|Yes| C[Clarification questions]
 C --> H[Human supplies answers]
 H --> N
 Q -->|No| B{Brownfield?}
 B -->|Yes| S[Repository scan and impact analysis]
 B -->|No| A[Solution architecture]
 S --> A
 A --> P[Create task DAG]
 P --> T1[API contract]
 P --> T2[Data model]
 P --> T3[Test design]
 T1 --> T4[API implementation]
 T2 --> T4
 T1 --> T5[Analytics implementation]
 T2 --> T5
 T1 --> T6[Documentation]
 T2 --> T6
 T3 --> T6
 T4 --> V[Validation]
 T5 --> V
 T6 --> V
 V -->|Fail| F[Diagnose failure]
 F --> X{Retry budget?}
 X -->|Yes| FIX[Targeted remediation]
 FIX --> V
 X -->|No| ESC[Human escalation]
 V -->|Pass| REV[Engineering review]
 REV --> AP[Human approval]
 AP -->|Approve| PR[Reviewable PR]
 AP -->|Reject| P
